<title>SRI LANKA: CT Land Q1 net falls slightly.</title>
<headline>CT Land Q1 net falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the three months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				   Q1 96/97	    Q1 95/96</p>
<p>    Turnover		    26.10     vs	 23.46</p>
<p>    Net profit		  10.22     vs	 10.54</p>
<p>NOTE - CT Land Developments Ltd owns and manages the Majestic City shopping and office complex in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
